

pc072_mib_jtag_serial

Version = A
Subversion = 32

This file describes PCB fabrication details for the
JTAG/Serial mezzanine board for the MIB v3b 
for the DUNE timing system
 
contact:	David.Cussans@bristol.ac.uk
		tel: 0117 95 46879
		     0117 33 17199
		fax: 0117 925 5624


Files produced by Cadence Allegro PE24.1

Artwork:
--------

Format: Gerber RS-274X , parameters described in art_param.txt. 
All layers viewed from top

Build:
------

"PCBTrain" 4-layer build from Newbury
Immersion silver finish to outer layers

Layers as follows:

pc072_mib_jtag_32_TOP.art
pc072_mib_jtag_32_02_GND.art
pc072_mib_jtag_32_03_VCC.art
pc072_mib_jtag_32_BOTTOM.art

