------------

pc072_mib_jtag_32_SMBT.art
pc072_mib_jtag_32_SMTP.art

Colour - green. 

Solderpaste mask (N.B. No SMD components on bottom face of board)
-----------------

pc072_mib_jtag_32_SPBT.art
pc072_mib_jtag_32_SPTP.art

